ab Report: Comparing CNN architectures","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s1","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s2","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"We trained each model for 30 epochs with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s3","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Each experiment was repeated 3 times with different random seeds.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s4","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Figure 1 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s5","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"GRU outperforms ResNet-50 by 18 percentage points at epoch 30.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s6","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"GRU outperforms ResNet-50 by 23.3 percentage points at epoch 5 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s7","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"As shown in Figure 1, from epoch 20 to epoch 25, the F1 score of VGG-16 improves by a relative 31.7%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s8","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"From epoch 25 to epoch 30, the F1 score of ResNet-50 improves by a relative 7.2%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s9","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Figure 2 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s10","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"From epoch 4 to epoch 8, the test accuracy of Ours improves by a relative 15.3% (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s11","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"As shown in Figure 2, CNN attains a test accuracy of 77% at epoch 8.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s12","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Figure 3 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s13","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Transformer reaches 111.3% F1 score on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s14","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Transformer achieves 90.5% F1 score on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s15","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"As shown in Figure 3, GRU achieves 134.9% F1 score on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s16","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"On AG News, MobileNet is 10 points better than Transformer (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s17","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"Figure 4 shows the f1 score of ViT-S by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s18","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"ViT-S scores 59.2 points higher on IMDB than on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s19","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"ViT-S scores 9 points higher on IMDB than on SVHN (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s20","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, SVM obtains an accuracy of 87.8%.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_004_s21","report_id":"holdout2_004","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}